desc:Damei Ozone 12 Mastering Suite (All-In-One Native DSP)
author:Damei
version:3.0
about:
  100% Self-Contained Ozone 12 Advanced, Tonal Balance Control & Masterdesk Clone for REAPER.
  - Tonal Balance Control: 4-band macro target corridor (Low, Lo-Mid, Hi-Mid, High) matching CD commercial masters (-8.0 to -9.0 LUFS-I / -1.0 dBTP).
  - Anti-Ducking Sidechain HPF: 100 Hz detector HPF on bus glue compressor + asymmetrical opto ballistics completely eliminating kick pumping and ducking.
  - CD Master Target: Default reference benchmarks calibrated for -8.5 LUFS-I with -1.0 dBTP true-peak ceiling.
  - High-Legibility Typography: enlarged, crystal-clear text across all cards, meters, and modules.
  - Intelligent Normalization Engine: Auto-Normalize to Ceiling + Maximizer Drive pushing directly to -1.0 dBTP.
  - Multi-Page Navigation: Overview, Tonal Balance Control, Master EQ, Dynamics, Stereo Imager, Maximizer.
  - 4-Band Multiband Dynamics Engine (Linkwitz-Riley LR4 Crossovers with anti-flutter ballistics).
  - Algorithmic AI Master Assistant with Tonal Balance auto-matching and loudness calibration.

options:gmem=DameiMetering
options:no_meter
options:maxmem=2097152

in_pin:left input
in_pin:right input
out_pin:left output
out_pin:right output

slider1:0<0,9,1{CD (-8.5 LUFS),Spotify (-14.0 LUFS),Apple Music (-16.0 LUFS),Amazon Music (-14.0 LUFS),Tidal (-14.0 LUFS),YouTube (-14.0 LUFS),SoundCloud (-9.0 LUFS),Bandcamp (-11.0 LUFS),Deezer (-14.0 LUFS),Qobuz Hi-Res (-13.0 LUFS)}>-Platform Target Reference
slider2:0<0,6,1{Overview,Tonal Balance,Master EQ,Dynamics,Stereo Imager,Maximizer,Mastering Playbook & Secret Weapons}>-Active Module
